    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ziggy is a challenging platformer about a small lightning bolt trying to get back home. Your main objective is to go through all the traps and reach the end. Can you do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the adventure, Ziggy will run, jump over obstacles, use the double jump to jump over even bigger obstacles, use his air boost ability to avoid traps, jump and slide along walls and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skills:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/cc60da43f74967631f6d333fc80d0d36.poster.avif?t=1728298416\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/cc60da43f74967631f6d333fc80d0d36.webm?t=1728298416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/cc60da43f74967631f6d333fc80d0d36.mp4?t=1728298416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">wall Slide<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/c42edb9377629c04b1c22d175661e85a.poster.avif?t=1728298416\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/c42edb9377629c04b1c22d175661e85a.webm?t=1728298416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/c42edb9377629c04b1c22d175661e85a.mp4?t=1728298416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Double jump<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/11cec755d139cfa8bd89f6db60ff7aaa.poster.avif?t=1728298416\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/11cec755d139cfa8bd89f6db60ff7aaa.webm?t=1728298416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/11cec755d139cfa8bd89f6db60ff7aaa.mp4?t=1728298416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/67f692cc7ea5425893f1e3f4ed0c82bd.poster.avif?t=1728298416\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/67f692cc7ea5425893f1e3f4ed0c82bd.webm?t=1728298416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190320/extras/67f692cc7ea5425893f1e3f4ed0c82bd.mp4?t=1728298416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 30 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5 Biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A lot of different traps </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
